   * **Deterministic Multi-Signal Hybrid Ranking**: Reciprocal Rank Fusion ($k=60$) combining semantic vector similarity with BM25s sparse scoring, exact phrase matching boost ($+0.02$), and query term coverage boost ($+0.015 \times \text{coverage}$).
