3. **Adaptive Capability Provider Router (`services/router.py`)**:
   * Dynamically ranks executable candidate providers per capability (`SEARCH`, `METADATA`, `TRANSCRIPT`) based on circuit health state (`CLOSED` > `HALF_OPEN`), historical success rate, and rolling average latency.
