   - Left sidebar mobile me smooth slide-in drawer ban gaya hai with backdrop blur.
   - Drawer ke header me **Nexora Icon Mark** + `X` close button diya hai with 44px touch-friendly hit areas.

3. **Mobile On-Page Section Quick Jump (`DocPageRenderer.tsx`)**:
   - Mobile screens par page title ke neeche **"On this page (N sections)"** dropdown add kiya hai, jisse mobile users direct specific sections par jump kar sakte hain without scrolling infinitely.

