   - Parameter tables aur code snippets ko responsive touch-scroll wrappers me encapsulate kiya hai (`overflow-x-auto`), taaki phone screens par page zoom/scroll issue na aaye.

5. **Interactive Live Explorer on Mobile**:
   - Tool selector, parameters inputs, aur response view mobile me vertically stack ho jate hain with dedicated **Copy JSON** and **Reset** touch buttons.

